{
  "algorithm": "Per case and delta the lcg32 generator is restarted from the seed. Walking the input depth-first in authored key order, every numeric x, y and z of an object stored under the key position, a or b (listener, sources, wall endpoints, primitives and tape events) takes one draw u; the coordinate moves by -delta when u < 0.5 and by +delta otherwise. Room, portal and height fields are not touched. Hybrid documents get their classic projection hash recomputed. The perturbed output is compared with the unperturbed output of the same code under comparison-rules.json.",
